  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "First round is beer, second round is a question. Sit anywhere.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Well if it is not the man with the truck problems. Take a stool.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Sit down. You are carrying a long day and I can see it from here.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Two captains in town, and they are not friendly, and they are sharing a parking lot.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "The big order came in at four in the morning. Cash. That part is interesting.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Road south is fine if you leave before dark and you keep moving.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Tab is open but I am writing what I actually poured, not what you said.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Two drinks for one? Friend, I have seen that math before and it always ends at my register.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "context_tags": [
        "tavern",
        "greeting"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
